ack to  a sustainable body fat  if all of those are met all of those  conditions are met in a timely manner  within the first  you know three four five weeks after  competition you're at least  moving in those directions i would  expect that  you know with a with a steady rate of  weight regain and immediately getting to  a  a decent training volume and a decent  energy availability status i would say  somewhere within three to six months you  should be feeling pretty alright
 

